  (text "NFC: ST25DV04K dynamic tag (ISO 15693 / NFC Type 5), I2C on the system bus. The phone is the reader.\nChosen over NTAG I2C plus because its symbol is in the reviewed KiCad library; ST25DV04KC is the current revision - confirm pin compatibility.\nPowered from +3V3 (not switched) so it never loads the shared I2C bus. GPO is open-drain -> NFC_FD wakes the MCU on RF field.\nAntenna: FPC coil on the rear cover with ferrite, connected at J6. C56 is a tuning position, fitted only after measuring in the enclosure.\nNo secrets are ever written to this tag: it carries a signed pairing payload only."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid 60da6faf-ea9d-5deb-a798-3c8b8cecf0d7)
  )
